 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Reflexive verbs",
     "texto": [
      "**Sich treffen** and **sich freuen** here take a reflexive pronoun in the accusative: **ich treffe mich**, **du triffst dich**, **er/sie/es trifft sich**, **wir treffen uns**, **ihr trefft euch**, **sie/Sie treffen sich**. The verb ending changes with the person, just as with other verbs."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "To be happy about something",
     "texto": [
      "With **sich freuen** you use **auf** for something coming up (to look forward to), and, if it has already happened, **über**: **Ich freue mich auf den Urlaub** (I'm looking forward to the holiday). The pronoun doesn't change position: **Wir freuen uns auf das Konzert**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
